'''Hutt's Grotto''' was a business at [[Stobar Spaceport]] during the [[Clone Wars]],<ref name="Brothers" /> and [[Havoc Outpost]]<ref name="Sisters" /> and [[Horizon Base]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]].<ref name="Forgotten" /> During the [[First Order-Resistance War]], an advertisement for the business was seen on the exterior of [[Vranki's Hotel and Casino]], a [[space station]] in the [[Voxx Cluster]].<ref name="Voxx">{{Resistance|The Voxx Vortex 5000}}</ref>

The advertisement featured a multicolored sign stating the business' name in [[Outer Rim Basic]], and a [[human]] [[Mouth|lip]] mark.<ref name="Sisters" /> At least two different [[color]] palettes were used, with the sign from the Clone Wars transforming from orange, white and bright green, to pink, white and blueish-green;<ref name="Brothers" /> while the one seen during the Galactic Civil War and First Order-Resistance War only featured the second palette.<ref name="Sisters" /> The business was named after the [[Hutt]]s,<ref name="Brothers" /> a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] from [[Nal Hutta]].<ref name="Nal Hutta">{{TCW|Hunt for Ziro}}</ref>

